<p>Hey <%= @user.first_name_or_fallback %>,</p>

<p>
  We disconnected “<%= @app_name %>” from your Dabble Me account
  (<%= @user.email %>) as a precaution. It sent us a sign-in key it had already
  swapped for a new one, which can mean a copy of the key ended up somewhere else.
  This is rare, and it is sometimes just the app glitching.
</p>

<p>If you still use <%= @app_name %>, connect it again. Your journal is unchanged.</p>

<p>
  If anything looks off, check
  <%= link_to "Connected apps", security_url(anchor: "connected-apps") %>
  and <%= link_to "change your password", edit_user_registration_url %>.
</p>

<p>
  <br>
  Thanks,
  <br>
  Dabble Me
</p>
